<div class="space-y-4">
  <div class="gw-window gw-frame p-6 leading-relaxed">
    <%= render 'documentation/breadcrumb', page: 'Monthly AT Commands' %>

    <h1 class="font-display text-gold-300 text-2xl tracking-wide m-0 mt-3">Monthly Automated Tournament Commands</h1>
    <p class="text-muted mt-1 mb-0">Manage monthly AT registration (every 3rd Saturday)</p>

    <div class="flex gap-6 mt-6">
      <%= render 'documentation/sidebar' %>
      <div class="flex-1 min-w-0 gw-doc">
        <h2>Command Reference</h2>

        <div class="rounded border border-gold-600/40 p-3 mb-5 text-sm">
          <strong>Note:</strong> Monthly ATs occur on the 3rd Saturday of every month.
          Registration opens 4 weeks (28 days) before the event.
        </div>

        <div class="mb-5 space-y-1">
          <h3>/mat schedule</h3>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Description:</strong> Set the monthly AT schedule pattern</p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Usage:</strong> <code>/mat schedule every_3rd_saturday</code></p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Response:</strong> <code>&lt;@user&gt;, this server now tracks monthly AT with pattern **every_3rd_saturday**; reminders will post in this channel. Next monthly AT: &lt;date&gt;.</code></p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-5 space-y-1">
          <h3>/mat next</h3>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Description:</strong> Show time until the next monthly AT</p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Usage:</strong> <code>/mat next</code></p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Response (before registration opens):</strong> <code>&lt;@user&gt;, the next monthly AT starts in 25d 12h (&lt;date&gt;). Registration opens in 3d 6h.</code></p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Response (during registration):</strong> <code>&lt;@user&gt;, the next monthly AT starts in 25d 12h (&lt;date&gt;). Registration is OPEN!</code></p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-5 space-y-1">
          <h3>/mat join</h3>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Description:</strong> Post the Monthly AT registration panel</p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Usage:</strong> <code>/mat join</code></p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Response:</strong> Posts an interactive panel with Register/Unregister buttons</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-5 space-y-1">
          <h3>/mat players</h3>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Description:</strong> List players registered for the monthly AT</p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Usage:</strong> <code>/mat players</code></p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Response:</strong></p>
          <pre class="bg-ink-deep border border-gold-600/50 rounded p-3 overflow-x-auto text-sm">&lt;@user&gt;, the current monthly AT queue players for this server are:
#1 &lt;@player1&gt; (**IGN1**)
#2 &lt;@player2&gt; (**IGN2**)
...
We need X more players.</pre>
        </div>

        <% if @next_monthly_at %>
          <div class="mt-8">
            <h2>Schedule Information</h2>
            <div class="gw-parchment rounded-md border border-gold-600/40 p-4">
              <h3 class="m-0">Next Monthly AT</h3>
              <p class="m-0 mt-2">
                <strong><%= @next_monthly_at.strftime('%B %d, %Y') %></strong> (3rd Saturday)<br>
                Registration opens: <strong><%= (@next_monthly_at - 28.days).strftime('%B %d, %Y') %></strong>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        <% end %>

        <div class="mt-8">
          <h2>Related Pages</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><%= link_to 'View all tournaments', tournaments_path %></li>
            <li><%= link_to 'Daily AT commands', at_doc_path %></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
